<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS5" title="In 3 Sparse Query Attention (SQA) ‣ Sparse Query Attention (SQA): A Computationally Efficient Attention Mechanism with Query Heads Reduction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.5 </span>Comparative Positioning</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
